    },
    {
      "id": "fall-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "同一年进入秋天后，"
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "房间"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 的异常从暗示变成公开的威胁。电视画面、血迹与窗外出现的黑暗身影让此前零散的不安指向同一件事：劳拉 的命运已经发生严重转折。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "By fall of the same year, the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "room"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " stops merely hinting at danger. Television imagery, blood, and a dark figure outside point toward a severe turn in Laura’s fate."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fall-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "与 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "哈维"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 有关的暴力场景进一步破坏了春天留下的安全感。此处不需要把每个超现实画面解释成唯一答案；更重要的是记录它们如何把记忆从“房间”推向“创伤”。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Violence involving "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "Harvey"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " further destroys the safety associated with spring. The reader does not force every surreal image into a single answer; the important shift is from room-as-home to room-as-trauma."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fall-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "黑色方块再次出现并结束这一季。重复出现的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "黑色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 让三个季节被读成同一套记忆系统中的连续档案，而不是三个互不相干的密室。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "black cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " closes the season again. Its recurrence turns the first three seasons into connected records inside one memory system rather than unrelated escape rooms."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fall-event",
      "type": "event",
      "eventId": "seasons-event-fall-1971",
      "summary": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "秋季记忆把故事从“不祥预感”推进到“事件已经发生”的阶段。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The fall memory moves the story from ominous anticipation to the sense that the event has already happened."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "structural-label",
        "sourceIds": [
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
